{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52231","headline":"颂六十二首 五十六 · 道世","name":"颂六十二首 五十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"邈邈爱王城，峨峨欣鹫岭。\n业结三界狱，利钝十使颈。\n浊恶顺下趣，断漏升上顶。\n着我甘苦报，怖象投丘井。\n翘翘羡化伦，念念除心瘿。\n宿佑遇释尊，高慕大仙颖。\n既破无明结，还同欣鹫岭。\n荷戢怡冲心，随憇靡不静。\n（见同书卷九十《断障部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道世","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52231.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52231","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}